  "description": "A brief sentence flowed from her husband's mouth.\n\n\"Let's get a divorce.\"\n\nVendia Rose dropped the divorce papers she had just handed to him.\n\n'W-Wait, this isn't how it's supposed to go...?'\n\nBelieving she was in a \"regret genre\" story, Vendia thought that demanding a divorce would spark the beginning of true love with the male lead.\n\nHowever, contrary to her expectations, the divorce was finalized in a flash, leaving her to live in a rundown mansion she received as alimony.\n\n'Alright, let's take this opportunity to live as a god-tier landlord!'\n\nBut how much time had passed since she made that ambitious resolution?\n\n\"When are you going to install the fireplace?!\" A nightmare tenant demanding a working fireplace in the middle of summer.\n\n\"M-Master, should I bury them?\" A property manager with a suspiciously dark mindset that heavily contrasts with his innocent appearance.\n\n\"It has been a while, Madam.\" And even her ex-husband, who had so coldly accepted the divorce?!\n\nWhy is everyone starting to gather here?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69915336/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A0%80-%ED%9B%84%ED%9A%8C%EB%AC%BC-%EC%97%AC%EC%A3%BC-%EC%95%84%EB%8B%88%EC%97%88%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94/4936)",
